        "markdown": "# Lionel Media Reaction Study 03\n\n## Annotated Media Reaction\n\nA transcript-grounded map of a Lionel episode organized around a Candace Owens clip.\n\n**20:56 total**  \n**about 15 minutes of source playback and interruption**  \n**nested source media**  \n**first direct evidence for a reusable commentary node**\n\n`FRAME SOURCE -> PLAY -> PAUSE -> INTERPRET -> EXPAND -> RESUME -> SYNTHESIZE`\n\nThis is the specimen we were missing.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786054301604,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study03-source",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Source and Attribution",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -1180,
