        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-media-reaction-study-03"
        },
        "markdown": "# 1 · Lionel Frames the Source\n## 0:00–1:09\n\nLionel praises Candace's expertise and presents the coming segment as an exemplary piece of explanation and prosecutorial-style argument. He also announces the interaction contract: he will stop the clip, perhaps annoyingly, to explain why it is important. \n\n**Function:** select the source, establish its importance, tell the audience how to watch it, and authorize future interruptions.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786054301604,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
