        },
        "markdown": "# 2 · First Playback and Referent Identification\n## 1:09–3:51\n\nThe source begins with a hypothetical grieving widow. Lionel immediately interrupts to identify the implied comparison with Erica Kirk, then expands into the Butler narrative and why some viewers remain suspicious. \n\n**Function:** decode an implied reference before the source fully develops it.\n\n**Commentary role:** `identifies referent` plus `adds background context`.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786054301604,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study03-seg3",
      "type": "markdown",
