        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-media-reaction-study-03"
        },
        "markdown": "# 3 · Comparison Expansion\n## 3:51–6:06\n\nCandace contrasts Helen Comperatore's continued questions and grief with Erica Kirk's public behavior. Lionel pauses to endorse the comparison and adds another example of bereavement that he considers more natural than choreographed or performative grief. \n\n**Function:** take the source's comparison and broaden it with an additional example.\n\n**Commentary role:** `validates comparison` plus `adds analogy`.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786054301604,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study03-seg4",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "4 · Nested Interview Playback",
      "root": false,
