      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-media-reaction-study-03"
        },
        "markdown": "# 4 · Nested Interview Playback\n## 6:06–8:57\n\nThe Candace clip itself plays portions of a NewsNation interview with Helen Comperatore. The interview includes questions about Secret Service failures, whether the gunman acted alone, and what Helen wants from President Trump. Lionel reacts with approval and uses the interview to defend suspicion as a normal human response rather than proof of irrationality. \n\n**Function:** comment on a source that contains another source.\n\nThis establishes a three-level media stack:\n\n**Lionel episode -> Candace segment -> NewsNation interview**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786054301604,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
