        },
        "markdown": "# 7 · Post-Clip Synthesis\n## 16:10–20:05\n\nLionel announces that the clip has ended, praises it as a near-perfect closing argument, and summarizes why he finds it effective: clarity, emotion, and the ability to make the audience see the issue differently. He then widens the frame to Candace's broader research network and rejects “conspiracy theorist” as a meaningful dismissal. \n\n**Function:** evaluate the source as a finished artifact and reconnect it to Lionel's larger worldview.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
